WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.517
The idea.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.896
Today, it often goes like this: copy a prompt, run an installer, and hope nothing breaks.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.922
Here, every building block is signed and pinned by its checksum.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.039
Every installation runs walled off in a sandbox.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.446
And your own Claude credentials never leave your device.

6
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.740
Your browser checks the signature itself, before anything starts.

7
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.012
Trust you can verify.
